 story and  are inspired by it i don't let that  concrete and steal  and raise the wire become what i  was going to see as my future a life  forever  so even in the darkest times as long as  you have hope  and you can still dream there's nothing  there is  nothing that can hold you back that was  our vlad duterte reporting of course  it it's this is an amazing woman i mean  to be able to be able to say  you're sorry but i've been blessed after  she even though she spent  nearly 22 years in prison yep i've met  her a couple times number one she's  lovely she's strong and she is a  she's now dedicating her life to helping  others she's a perfect example  of what is wrong with the criminal  justice system and why there need to be  some major changes there  if you doubt that just listen to alice  marie johnson's story it's an amazing  story and  vlad had a very funny moment we shot it  a little differently so if you're like  me going why'd he do it that way i do  not know but  it was a little i was trying to  disclaimer yeah  i was trying to figure that out too but  he had a very funny moment where he said  um when alice first went in you know  social  media was not a big deal so when she  heard that she had gone viral  she didn't know what that meant and she  saw she thought that she had given the  internet a virus  people that she had infected people so  no alice marie johnson you did not do  that  we are so glad that you're out and we're  so glad that you were able to tell your  story and  she's on deck tonight she's speaking at  the room very much looking forward to it  she said kim kardashian west  was an angel in her life who brought her  to the attention to the trump  administration  and she's out and she will be speaking  tonight i can't wait to hear what she's  got to say  all right we'll be right back stay with  us

